<p>Unfortunately, if you do that, the nearest node is the &quot;A New Alliance&quot; node, and you will have to go all the way through Lazvil Hills and Judgement Cliff again.  However, if you use Stocke&#x27;s Vanish ability and bypass all the enemies, you can make it back to Skalla in a couple minutes.  Return to the same decision and choose to &quot;Send soul to heavens&quot; to advance the [Wandering Soul] sidequest.  When you are ready, rest up at the inn, leave Skalla, and head for the Itolia Wasteland.</p>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
