<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Gafka&#x27;s Homeland">
<p>The shops are not open yet, but I figured I&#x27;d list them here anyway.  To the left of the entrance is a hidden chest which contains 4000 G.  On the opposite side to the right is another hidden chest which contains the STRONGMAN BOOK for Gafka later.  In the northern half of the village, search the right side for a slightly concealed barrel.  Drag it to the left to blow away the rocks to gain access to a chest which contains 2 TOURNIQUETS.  Finally, climb up to the wooden deck and pass up the houses to the left.  Search the upper left corner for a chest which contains the GIANT CAPE (DEF+45/MDF+33/SPD-3, equip on Aht).</p>
</Callout>

<p>Enter the upper house and talk to the elder, Galva, to discuss what you will need to do next.</p>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
