<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Battle for Skalla">
<p>[Rosch&#x27;s Stratagem node] Although the plot automatically takes you to Skalla, you can indeed leave and return to Forgia, which you should do to make the recommended purchases listed above.  The Beast Charms should go to Gafka and Rosch.  The Rook Studs should go to Aht and Marco.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Back at Skalla, the only new thing here is the cage with the Gutrals in it. Head to the inn to discuss your plan.  Afterwards, some soldiers will appear to the left of the inn.  Talk to them to initiate the plan.</p>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Alistel Officer, Alistel Soldier x2 WEAKNESS: None STRATEGY: Alistel Officer has a Fidele Epee (ATK+58) that Stocke could use, but I prefer keeping him as a magic user.  Do not use Push Assaults on them, because this will put them in formation.  Instead, have Marco use Magic Rise to boost everyone&#x27;s magic.  Use the Change command to string together at least five consecutive turns, then use two Right Assault and any three G-elemental spells to defeat the Soldiers.  Two more G-spells should finish the Officer. *******************************************************************************</p>

<p>After defeating them, talk to Rosch again and tell him that you&#x27;re ready to begin the next phase of the plan.</p>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
