<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Skalla Liberated">
<p>[Sand Fortress Siege node] After a lengthy scene, you will be back at Forgia.  Talk to Galva to receive [The Beast God&#x27;s Birth] sidequest.  Unlike any other shop in the game, Forgia&#x27;s shops change their inventory mid-chapter, where you should make the recommended purchased listed above.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Back at the village entrance, talk to Bergas to the right to receive the [Gafka &amp; the Scrolls] and [The Ultimate Skill] sidequests.  With the Strongman Book you found earlier, talk to him again and have Gafka fight him.  One shot of Gafka&#x27;s Sky Hammer Mana Burst will defeat him.  For doing so, Gafka will learn Musou, which deals 10 hits per use, and is incredible for creating massive combos, though it only works on the center enemy.  If only there were another ability that would move all enemies to the center panel...</p>

<p>Leave the village and head back to Skalla for some more scenes.  Before heading to the Sand Fortress, find Vanoss on the upper left side of town.  Talk to him to complete the [Wandering Soul] sidequest and receive the CLEANSING CAPE (DEF+30/MDF+36/MAG+5, sell).  Then, talk to Rosch to begin the invasion of the Sand Fortress.</p>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Pieti Edge, Moirae Manteau, Crystal Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Phase Spear, Tungsten Mail, Crystal Charm x3<br/>Marco: Gaia Blade, Tungsten Mail, Rook Stud x3<br/>Rosch: Death Pike, Bloody Armor, Beast Charm x3<br/>Aht: Promised Knife, Giant Cape, Rooks Stud x3<br/>Gafka: Death Claw, Bestial Soul, Beast Charm x3<br/>Extra: Freikugel Argent, Gospel Armor, Skull Dress</p>
</Callout>

