  <!-- Chapter 57 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch57"
    number={57}
    title="Sand Fortress (Alternate Chapter 5)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="56"
      party="Stocke, Gafka, Rosch"
      
      enemies={[{"name": "Alistel Soldier"}, {"name": "Auto Defender"}, {"name": "Prod. Thaumachine", "weakness": "Lightning"}]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Commander&#x27;s Fall">
<p>I&#x27;d recommend fighting every enemy you can around here to get some much-needed experience for Rosch &amp; Gafka.  If necessary, Rosch&#x27;s Cross Spike can be useful for taking out those Auto Defenders.  Otherwise, just head straight up the middle to the third floor.  Then, walk around the right side and up the stairs. Bring in Aht to replace Gafka and continue up to meet the commander.</p>
</Callout>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Cannon x2, Thaumaton WEAKNESS: Fire, Lightning STRATEGY: Use a Magic Herb on Stocke and have him cast Heat Blade to take out the two Cannons.  Then, use a Magic Herb on Aht, lay out a couple Volt Star Traps, and Grapple the Thaumaton onto them for a quick victory. *******************************************************************************</p>

<p>After the battle, Bergas will arrive to prompt you for a decision on your next move.  Make sure to choose &quot;Bring back now&quot;, as this is a requirement to unlocking the [At Journey&#x27;s End] sidequest.  Either way, the plot will proceed the same way.</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Forbidden Weaponry">
<p>Talk to Rosch and join the meeting.  After some dialogue, you will be prompted for a decision.  Choosing to &quot;Accept the truce&quot; will unlock the [Divine Judgement] ending.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Etherion">
<p>Before moving on, return to the &quot;Gafka &amp; the Scrolls&quot; node and head to Skalla. Talk to Marco by the item shop.  If you have been following the walkthrough, you will finally receive the [At Journey&#x27;s End] sidequest.  If not, search for &quot;At Journey&#x27;s End&quot; in the walkthrough to find the three prerequisites you need to make.  Oddly enough, one of the choices occurs AFTER this point in the plot, yet affects it retroactively.</p>
</Callout>

<p>Talk to Raynie by the inn to be prompted for a decision.  Choosing &quot;I&#x27;ll stop fighting&quot; will unlock the [Oncoming Calamity] ending.  Return to the same decision point and choose &quot;I can&#x27;t give up&quot; to advance the [At Journey&#x27;s End] sidequest.  Talk to Marco again to complete the [At Journey&#x27;s End] sidequest and receive the PRIERE BONHEUR (ATK+15/MAG+52/Fear Res+5, equip on Raynie).</p>

<p>When you are ready, return to the &quot;Etherion&quot; node and choose to &quot;Reject the truce.&quot;  However, someone else has different ideas.</p>

<p>******************************************************************************* BOSS TIME: Shadow x3 WEAKNESS: Poison STRATEGY: Start by using Right Assault on the Shadow in the back row.  Then, use the Change command to string together five consecutive turns.  Lay any Star Trap in the lower left corner.  Finally, from the lower right Shadow, use Right Assault, Push Assault, Left Assault, and Left Assault to defeat them all, using Eruca&#x27;s Trans-turn, as needed. *******************************************************************************</p>

<Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: Royal Talisman">
<p>[A Black Disciple node] After surviving the battle, everyone will discuss the assault on Granorg.</p>
</Callout>

<Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
<p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>Stocke: Pieti Edge, Moirae Manteau, Crystal Charm x3<br/>Raynie: Priere Bonheur, Tungsten Mail, Crystal Charm x3<br/>Marco: Gaia Blade, Tungsten Mail, Rook Stud x3<br/>Aht: Promised Knife, Giant Cape, Rook Stud x3<br/>Gafka: Death Claw, Bestial Soul, Beast Charm x3<br/>Eruca: Freikugel Argent, Skull Dress, Crystal Charm x3<br/>Extra: Gospel Armor</p>
</Callout>

<p>=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=</p>
